"getSize", "parameters": "(long size)", "modifiers": "public static", "return": "String", "body": "public static String getSize(long size){\n        String resultSize;\n        if (size / GB >= 1) {\n            //\u5982\u679c\u5f53\u524dByte\u7684\u503c\u5927\u4e8e\u7b49\u4e8e1GB\n            resultSize = DF.format(size / (float) GB) + \"GB   \";\n        } else if (size / MB >= 1) {\n            //\u5982\u679c\u5f53\u524dByte\u7684\u503c\u5927\u4e8e\u7b49\u4e8e1MB\n            resultSize = DF.format(size / (float) MB) + \"MB   \";\n        } else if (size / KB >= 1) {\n            //\u5982\u679c\u5f53\u524dByte\u7684\u503c\u5927\u4e8e\u7b49\u4e8e1KB\n            resultSize = DF.format(size / (float) KB) + \"KB   \";\n        } else {\n            resultSize = size + \"B   \";\n        }\n        return resultSize;\n    }", "signature": "String getSize(long size)", "full_signature": "public static String getSize(long size)", "class_method_signature": "FileUtil.getSize(long size)", "testcase": false, "constructor": false, "invocations": ["format", "format", "format"]}, "repository": {"repo_id": 220248572, "url": "https://github.com/guchengwuyue/yshopmall", "stars": 65, "created": "11/7/2019 1:53:52 PM +00:00", "updates": "2020-01-25T05:33:14+00:00", "fork": "False", "license": "licensed"}}